#: ../cli/index.md:1
msgid "CLI"
msgstr "CLI"

#: ../cli/index.md:3
msgid ""
"Once `pyvista-js` has been installed, a [console "
"script](https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/entry_point.html) "
"will be available with several convenience commands to assist with browser-"
"based 3-D visualization."
msgstr ""
"`pyvista-js` のインストールが完了すると、ブラウザベースの3D可視化を支援する便利なコマンドがいくつか用意された "
"[コンソールスクリプト](https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/entry_point.html)"
" が利用可能になります。"

#: ../cli/index.md:17
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "コマンド"

